  "After an ally uses a skill, Futaba gains 5% to her Analysis Progress. Also when an ally deals weakness damage with a skill, Resonance, Highlight, or Theurgy, Futaba gains 20% more to her Analysis Progress.\\nWhen Data Storm is active, increase the party's damage by 10%/15%/20% based on Futaba's level (effect changes at Lv. 1/50/70, respectively); if dealing weakness damage, double this damage increase.": "",
