  "Increase the skill level of Pentest Complete! by 3.": "",
  "When Futaba uses Data Link Established!, target all allies, and also inflict Virus on all foes corresponding to an ally's attribute (Viruses of the same attribute do not stack).\\nIncrease the duration of Data Storm to 3 turns, and increase allies' weakness damage by 10%, and damage dealt by 25%.": "",
